# CSV Helper

This skill helps you with CSV files. CSV files are comma-separated values files that store tabular data, and they are very common in many different situations.

You should always be careful when working with CSV files. Make sure the data is correct and that nothing goes wrong.

When you work with CSV files, try to do a good job and follow best practices. Be thorough.
